  "home.hero.p": {
    en: "Personalised weekly updates, fetal development insights, meal plans and emotional support, every week. And if something feels wrong, Bumply spots the danger signs and helps you reach care.",
    pcm: "Weekly updates, how your baby dey grow, meal plans and care, every week. And if anything no dey alright, Bumply go sabi am quick and help you reach hospital.",
    yo: "Àwọn ìròyìn ọ̀sọ̀ọ̀sẹ̀, ìdàgbàsókè ọmọ inú, ètò oúnjẹ àti ìtìlẹ́yìn ọkàn lọ́sọ̀ọ̀sẹ̀. Bí nǹkan kan bá sì burú, Bumply yóò mọ àmì ewu, yóò sì ràn ọ́ lọ́wọ́ láti dé ilé ìwòsàn.",
    ha: "Sabbin labarai na mako-mako, yadda jaririn yake girma, shirye-shiryen abinci da tallafi. In wani abu bai yi kyau ba, Bumply zai gane alamun hatsari ya taimaka miki ka isa asibiti.",
    ig: "Mmelite kwa izu, otu nwa si eto, atụmatụ nri na nkwado obi. Ọ bụrụ na ihe adịghị mma, Bumply ga-achọpụta akara ihe ize ndụ ma nyere gị aka iru ụlọ ọgwụ.",
  },
