  "home.testi2": { en: "\"Seeing my baby's actual photo every week makes it so real. I didn't know what a 14-week baby looked like until Bumply showed me.\"", pcm: "\"To see my baby actual photo every week make am real. I no know wetin 14-week baby look like until Bumply show me.\"", yo: "\"Rírí àwòrán ọmọ mi gan-an lọ́sọ̀ọ̀sẹ̀ jẹ́ kí ó dàbí òtítọ́. Èmi kò mọ̀ bí ọmọ ọ̀sẹ̀ 14 ṣe rí títí Bumply fi fihàn mí.\"", ha: "\"Ganin hoton jaririna na gaske kowane mako yana sa ya zama na gaske. Ban san yadda jariri na mako 14 yake ba sai da Bumply ya nuna min.\"", ig: "\"Ịhụ ezigbo foto nwa m kwa izu na-eme ka ọ bụrụ eziokwu. Amaghị m otú nwa izu 14 si dị ruo mgbe Bumply gosiri m.\"" },
  "home.testi3": { en: "\"First pregnancy and I was terrified. The reassurance notes for first-time moms made me feel so seen. I genuinely look forward to my updates.\"", pcm: "\"First pregnancy and I dey fear. The reassurance notes for first-time moms make me feel say dem see me. I dey really look forward to my updates.\"", yo: "\"Oyún àkọ́kọ́, ẹ̀rù sì bà mí. Àwọn àkọsílẹ̀ ìmúgbọ́ọ̀rọ́ fún àwọn ìyá tuntun jẹ́ kí n rí i pé a kíyèsí mi. Mo ń fojúsọ́nà ìròyìn mi ní tòótọ́.\"", ha: "\"Ciki na farko kuma na ji tsoro. Saƙonnin ƙarfafawa ga sababbin uwaye sun sa na ji an gan ni. Da gaske ina sa ran sabunta labaraina.\"", ig: "\"Afọ ime mbụ ma ụjọ tụrụ m. Ozi nkasi obi maka ndị nne mbụ mere ka m hụ na a hụrụ m. Ana m ele anya mmelite m n'ezie.\"" },
